{
  "id": "ch04_s05_yeting",
  "chapter": 4,
  "act": 4,
  "scene": "yeting",
  "palette": "ink",
  "cast": [
    "wuze",
    "tangjian",
    "songhuizhen",
    "adi",
    "shenheng",
    "peizhaoye",
    "wenqiao",
    "liqinghe"
  ],
  "require": {
    "flag.enthroned": true
  },
  "weightless": false,
  "leavesLetter": [],
  "purpose": "付清这批劳动并展示复核如何实际运行",
  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l1",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "数日后，掖庭晾起洗过的布，湿气贴着廊柱。阿荻把钱一枚枚分开。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l2",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这一份够了。我收。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l3",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "还留这边做么？"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l4",
      "who": "adi",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我那边已定。今日来领钱。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l5",
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她还赶得上那边的饭。别再拿一叠稿叫她顺路。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l6",
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "代班、核旧款的人也分别领过，观中俸钱有收凭；未付的另列，不能把空栏算清。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l7",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "阿荻提起自己的布包，走到门口，又回身拿走漏下的针。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l8",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_contract_registration": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "两人来核的已经收件。我的第二个名字仍空着，等她自己来答。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l9",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_separate_authorization": true
      },
      "who": "songhuizhen",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "我授的照料凭收了。她自己那份，她另定，没叫我一同带来签。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l10",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_dissent_retained": true,
        "flag.ch04_originals_retained": true
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原议本人按权限查过原案，指出摘要少字。更正已附，核办人今日具名答了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l11",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_dissent_retained": true,
        "flag.ch04_originals_retained": true
      },
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "原摘要也留着，叫后来的人知道改过哪一笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l12",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_dissent_retained": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "议录查不到她来时的原问，只能看你的答复。新补的工钱，不会让那一页回来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l13",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_dissent_retained": true,
        "flag.ch04_originals_retained": false
      },
      "who": "tangjian",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "她的异议在册，原件却已烧了。我们能记她说漏了字，不能再验原笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l14",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "傍晚，沈来领私物，绕开了已经收回的公案。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l15",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_after_intercept_meet": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你那回愿另听，回话没有夹进公卷。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l16",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch02_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回的那首诗，我留在无案号的纸里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l17",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch02_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那封你没有回。我没有再添一张催你的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l18",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_after_intercept_scope": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "截信后，你要先核已读的范围。我没添私话。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l19",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_after_intercept_private_stop": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那回你要公事另纸，我便收起了私笺。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l20",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_meet": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "撤差那封，你回了各自有空再约。我没替你填日子。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l21",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_wait": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "撤差那封，你说私见先缓。复议的纸照旧往来。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l22",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_stop": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回撤差那封，要停私笺。这回只带交付凭。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l23",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "撤差那封的回诗，我夹在旧笺里，没夹回驳语。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l24",
      "when": {
        "flag.shen_ch03_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "撤差后那封没等到回话，我便把余纸收了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l25",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_destroyed": true
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "物件齐了。我今日不留，也不接下一册。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l26",
      "when": {
        "flag.ch04_originals_destroyed": false
      },
      "who": "shenheng",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "手冷。这一页放回去了，我也该走了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l27",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "翌日裴来交领款凭，把背了半日的布包放到脚边。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l28",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_spare_time": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你叫我有自己的空闲再来。这半刻，我留出来了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l29",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你的回诗，我放在路书后面，没有拿去报程。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l30",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那封你没回，我便没叫人替你备马。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l31",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_check_again": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "补俸那封，你肯再核一次。我只列了那一次的账。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l32",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch02_pause_help": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你那回不接核账，也不约同行。我另请了人。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l33",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_meal": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "拔刺后那封，你说想吃顿热的。我还没报时辰。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l34",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_no_date": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你叫我别替旧友定日。到今日，那格仍空着。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l35",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_stop": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回拔刺那封，要停私约。我没多备一副行囊。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l36",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "拔刺那封的回诗，夹在路书末页，没交署里。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l37",
      "when": {
        "flag.pei_ch03_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "拔刺后那封没有回话。我照值次走，没托人问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l38",
      "who": "peizhaoye",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "人走了，钱才追到。我会另寄，不能叫她回来替我凑一个人钱都齐。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l39",
      "who": "wuze",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "这半张饼，你先吃完再走。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l40",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "温来取自己的纸样，掌根压过的白痕还在，纸槽的尺寸没有换新。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l41",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_read_again": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回信要照自己的快慢读。我没替你圈停处。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l42",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回的诗，我整张留着，没有替它改字。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l43",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那封你没回，后来的改稿我便留在自己案上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l44",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_keep_without_pardon": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "折鱼那封你收了，也叫我别替她猜。我没再猜。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l45",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch02_private_pause": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那回你只肯谈公事，我没有拿私笺充核稿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l46",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_sing": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "退钱那封，你还想听我唱错。曲子倒没催我唱准。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l47",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_fair_pay": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你说新槽的钱另算。稿工那一笔，我没挪。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l48",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_stop": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回退钱那封，说暂不合唱。我没在曲旁写你的名。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l49",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "退钱那封收了回诗，我用你写的字试过调。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l50",
      "when": {
        "flag.wen_ch03_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "退钱那封你没回，我收了余笺，照旧去刷纸槽。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l51",
      "who": "wenqiao",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "纸样只带了这一份。我留底的那张，背面还得写自己的诗。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l52",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "最后李取走未获采用的稿，外衣仍披在自己的肩上。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l53",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_meet": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你信里说时辰另约。我没把那句夹进朝班。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l54",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回的诗，放在我那张私纸下面，不带上殿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l55",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那封你没有回，原稿照样给你看。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l56",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_after_debate": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "交全稿那封，你要私话等比较后再问。没有算作应约。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l57",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_letter_public_only": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回全稿那封，说私邀到此。我把帖子收回了。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l58",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_walk": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "风筝那封，你想再走一段。我只记了一段。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l59",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_separate": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "你回风筝那封，说账各自算。我没挪你的那一笔。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l60",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_stop": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "风筝那封，你说私约停一停。我没把取稿写成相邀。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l61",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_poem": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "风筝那封的回诗，我放在私纸里，公议仍答原问。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l62",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch03_letter_silent": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "风筝那封没有回话。线收好了，没有另托人送去。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l63",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_private_yes": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那夜你留我坐过，次日也真来驳了。今日仍可各答各的。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l64",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_private_wait": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那夜你说改日再问。今日若仍想独处，也照旧说。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l65",
      "when": {
        "flag.li_ch02_private_no": true
      },
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "那夜只约论议，我记着。今日这份也是公稿。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l66",
      "who": "liqinghe",
      "expr": "default",
      "kind": "say",
      "text": "减掉的供给没有补回，我自己的账仍要算。若另约吃饭，不在这页上署。"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.l67",
      "who": "narr",
      "kind": "aside",
      "text": "你替她拾起卷边，放回她手里，没有把落选的那页扣住。"
    }
  ],
  "choices": [
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.cA",
      "text": "收好今日的交付凭",
      "require": {
        "flag.ch04_dissent_retained": true,
        "flag.ch04_originals_retained": true
      },
      "effects": {
        "flag.public_review": true
      },
      "irreversible": false,
      "goto": "ch04_s06_zhaoyang"
    },
    {
      "id": "ch04_s05_yeting.cB",
      "text": "收好今日的交付凭",
      "require": {
        "flag.ch04_dissent_retained": false
